From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Julian Vetter <julian.vetter@vates.tech>
Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 16:31:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] xenopsd/xc: mirror altp2m_count from
 Xenctrl.domctl_create_config
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit
Content-Type: text/plain; charset = "utf-8"
Content-Transfert-Encoding: 8bit

domctl_create_config here is a mirror of Xenctrl.domctl_create_config.
Xen's OCaml bindings gained the altp2m_count field in:

5699554de9a9 tools/ocaml: Add altp2m_count parameter
                      (Petr Beneš, 2025-08-25)

exposing the pre-existing altp2m.nr count (xen_domctl_createdomain),
alongside the existing altp2m_opts.

Signed-off-by: Julian Vetter <julian.vetter@vates.tech>

diff --git a/ocaml/xenopsd/xc/domain.ml b/ocaml/xenopsd/xc/domain.ml
index 1ae8c486b1cf..059333b9acf9 100644
--- a/ocaml/xenopsd/xc/domain.ml
+++ b/ocaml/xenopsd/xc/domain.ml
@@ -108,6 +108,7 @@ type domctl_create_config = Xenctrl.domctl_create_config = {
   ; max_maptrack_frames: int
   ; max_grant_version: int
   ; altp2m_opts: int32
+  ; altp2m_count: int32
   ; vmtrace_buf_kb: int32
   ; cpupool_id: int32
   ; arch: arch_domainconfig
@@ -518,6 +519,7 @@ let make ~xc ~xs vm_info vcpus domain_config uuid final_uuid no_sharept
             1
         )
     ; altp2m_opts= 0l
+    ; altp2m_count= 0l
     ; vmtrace_buf_kb= 0l
     ; cpupool_id= 0l
     ; arch= domain_config
